-% ohpc_indent 10
-\begin{lstlisting}[language=bash,keywords={},upquote=true,keepspaces]
-# Optionally, choose the Omni-Path enabled build for MVAPICH2. Otherwise, skip to retain IB variant
-[sms](*\#*) (*\install*) mvapich2-psm2-intel-ohpc
-\end{lstlisting}
-% ohpc_indent 5
-% ohpc_command fi
